    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="50">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 50</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif monnes \c/eacan mon forslihð, þæt hie beoð forode, gebete mid XV scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone strikes a man’s jaws, so that they are both broken [namely, upper and lower jawbones], let him pay with 15 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyones stikes another's jaws so violently that they are fractured, he shall pay 15 shillings as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif monnes ceacan mon forslyhð, ðæt hy beon forede, gebete mid XV scll'.</ab>
      </div>
